{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_016qM8qoS5EcvQVMfQFbNeLK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since Rust is not available in the current environment, I need to inform you that you'll need to run the tests manually. Let me provide you with the implementation summary:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the core data models for the calendar application:\n\n### 1. **Event Struct** (src/events/mod.rs:88-147)\nComplete implementation with all required fields:\n- `id`: Unique identifier (auto-generated)\n- `title`: Event title\n- `start_time`: Start time (NaiveDateTime)\n- `end_time`: End time (NaiveDateTime)\n- `description`: Optional description\n- `location`: Optional location\n- `recurring_rules`: Optional recurring rules\n- `category`: Optional category\n- `reminders`: Vector of reminders\n\n**Supporting Types:**\n- `RecurrenceFrequency` enum: Daily, Weekly, Monthly, Yearly\n- `RecurringRules` struct: frequency, interval, count, until\n- `Category` struct: name, color\n- `Reminder` struct: minutes_before, message\n\n**Builder Methods:**\n- `with_description()`, `with_location()`, `with_recurring_rules()`\n- `with_category()`, `add_reminder()`\n- `is_recurring()`, `duration_minutes()`\n\n### 2. **CalendarState Struct** (src/calendar/types.rs:44-168)\nComplete state management implementation:\n- `current_date`: Current date being viewed\n- `view_mode`: ViewMode enum (Day, Week, Month, Year)\n- `events`: Vector of all events\n- `selected_event_index`: Currently selected event\n\n**Key Methods:**\n- Event management: `add_event()`, `remove_event()`, `get_event()`, `get_event_mut()`\n- Event queries: `events_on_date()`, `events_in_range()`, `event_count()`\n- Navigation: `next_period()`, `previous_period()`, `go_to_today()`\n- Selection: `select_next_event()`, `select_previous_event()`, `selected_event()`\n- View: `set_view_mode()`\n\n### 3. **Serde Serialization**\nFull serialization/deserialization support for:\n- Event and all supporting types\n- CalendarState\n- All enums (ViewMode, RecurrenceFrequency)\n\n### 4. **Comprehensive Unit Tests**\n**Event tests** (9 tests in src/events/mod.rs:176-323):\n- Event creation and builder pattern\n- Recurring events\n- Duration calculation\n- Serialization/deserialization\n- Category and reminder creation\n\n**CalendarState tests** (21 tests in src/calendar/types.rs:175-411):\n- State creation and event management\n- Event queries (by date, by range)\n- View mode changes\n- Period navigation (day/week/month/year)\n- Event selection and wrapping\n- Event sorting\n- Serialization/deserialization\n\n## Next Steps\n\n**You need to run the following commands** (Rust is not available in my current environment):\n\n```bash\ncargo test\ncargo clippy\n```\n\nOnce the tests pass and clippy is satisfied, the code will be ready to commit."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":378,"cache_read_input_tokens":35251,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":378,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"51ef3dcb-d07e-498e-9b74-325eb1d04825","uuid":"22b8b5f4-4183-4197-b985-97b0e21d2f73"}
